			<attribute key="label" type="String">10x-pre-formatted
Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.
1. Normal test cases - length of the sequence is like 5, 8, 10 etc.
    i. First number is repeated in multiple places in the sequence
    ii. First number is repeated back to back in the sequence
    iii. First number is repeated and a few other numbers are also repeated
2. Boundary test cases
    i. Sequence contains only 1 number
    ii. First number is not repeated in the sequence
    iii. Entire sequence contains only a single number

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 6 new test cases.
Write them on a paper.</attribute>
