		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">44</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following is what I came up with.
1. Read sequence size
2. Read the first number
3. Write down the count as 1
4. Read the next number
5. Check if it is same as the first number
6. If yes increase the count
7. Repeat steps 4, 5 and 6 until you reach the end of the sequence
8. By the end, count will contain the number of occurrences of the first number</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">235.81071428571428</attribute>
