- Comparison operators: used for operations like &lt;, &lt;=, >, >=, ===, !==
- Conditional statement: used to decide between different actions
But in this problem we want to repeat some set of steps. None of the above concepts can do that.
Loops will help us to repeat a set of steps.</attribute>
