		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">55</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Note that there are 2 kinds of brackets here.
1. Circular brackets also known as Parantheses - opening bracket is "(", closing bracket is ")"
2. Flower brackets - opening bracket is "{", closing bracket is "}"

Then we also have semi-colons - (i.e. ";")</attribute>
